  "notes": "Remote JXCT seven-in-one soil probe on Dragino RS485-NB (NB-IoT). Wire sensor A/B to Dragino RS485; power probe 5–24 VDC (12 V typical). Default 9600 8N1, slave 1. Cloud: add Dragino gateway driver (dragino_rs485_nb), then POST /api/parc/dragino-gateway/bind-preset with presetId jxct_npk_jxbs3001_dragino (or jxct_npk_jxbs3001), then /plan for AT+COMMAND* + AT+TDC=300. Parc hub decodes Payload hex → SOIL_PH, SOIL_MOIST_PCT, SOIL_TEMP_C, SOIL_EC_US_CM, N/P/K. Local RS485 (no cellular): use jxct_npk_jxbs3001 instead."
